// A small zone for checking that the complete fastfile build path
// works.
//
// There is deliberately very little in it. One rawfile is enough to
// make the Linker produce something we can then install and read back
// with the Unlinker, so this gives a new checkout a real target without
// introducing any content that looks like part of the project itself.
//
// Note that zone/buildfile names this definition explicitly through the
// localized zone list. Once the project has a real zone, remove this
// file and replace that entry at the same time.
//
>game,IW4MS

rawfile,common_scripts/example.gsc
